# Model checkpoints: only the validated-best checkpoint ships; the rest are local artifacts.
# Chosen by evaluating all 40 checkpoints for EER on a 31-speaker set (10 dataset + 21 real
# enrolled speakers) — see docs/PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md. checkpoint_13 had the lowest EER (12.85%).
model_saved/checkpoint_*.pth
!model_saved/checkpoint_13.pth
